    "\u6536\u8D77\u8D44\u6E90\u5217\u8868": "R\xE9duire la liste des ressources",
    "\u5C55\u5F00\u8D44\u6E90\u5217\u8868": "D\xE9velopper la liste des ressources",
    "\u8FD4\u56DE\u8D44\u6E90\u5217\u8868": "Retour \xE0 la liste des ressources",
    "Service authentication required.": "Authentification du service requise.",
    "Request does not match an allowed operation.": "La requ\xEAte ne correspond pas \xE0 une op\xE9ration autoris\xE9e.",
    "Requested operation or resource was not found.": "L'op\xE9ration ou la ressource demand\xE9e est introuvable.",
    "Method not allowed.": "M\xE9thode non autoris\xE9e.",
    "Service is busy; retry later.": "Le service est occup\xE9\xA0; r\xE9essayez plus tard.",
    "Operation exceeded its deadline.": "L'op\xE9ration a d\xE9pass\xE9 son d\xE9lai.",
    "Result exceeds the response limit.": "Le r\xE9sultat d\xE9passe la limite de r\xE9ponse.",
    "Operation failed. Upstream details have been withheld.": "L'op\xE9ration a \xE9chou\xE9. Les d\xE9tails en amont ont \xE9t\xE9 retenus.",
    "CLI configuration is unavailable on the OpenChamber Server host.": "La configuration CLI n'est pas disponible sur l'h\xF4te OpenChamber Server.",
    "Host configuration is invalid. Check it on the server; contents are not disclosed.": "La configuration de l'h\xF4te n'est pas valide. V\xE9rifiez-le sur le serveur\xA0; le contenu n\u2019est pas divulgu\xE9.",
    "Selected CLI context is unavailable.": "Le contexte CLI s\xE9lectionn\xE9 n'est pas disponible.",
    "This connection mode is not supported. Kubernetes core mode cannot reuse an Argo CD token.": "Ce mode de connexion n'est pas pris en charge. Le mode principal de Kubernetes ne peut pas r\xE9utiliser un jeton CD Argo.",
    "Argo CD network access is disabled in host settings; approval is required before validation.": "L'acc\xE8s au r\xE9seau Argo CD est d\xE9sactiv\xE9 dans les param\xE8tres de l'h\xF4te\xA0; l\u2019approbation est requise avant la validation.",
    "Authentication failed. Log in again using the CLI on the OpenChamber Server host.": "L'authentification a \xE9chou\xE9. Connectez-vous \xE0 nouveau \xE0 l'aide de la CLI sur l'h\xF4te du serveur OpenChamber.",
