    "Host configuration is invalid. Check it on the server; contents are not disclosed.": "Ana makine yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131 ge\xE7ersiz. Sunucuda kontrol edin; i\xE7erikleri a\xE7\u0131klanmad\u0131.",
